<title>NETHERLANDS: Stork wins Kvaerner order.</title>
<headline>Stork wins Kvaerner order.</headline>
<dateline>NAARDEN, Netherlands 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial systems and services  group Stork NV said on Friday it had won an order worth 50 million  guilders from Norway's Kvaerner Oil &amp; Gas.</p>
<p>Stork unit Stork Engineers &amp; Contractors BV will engineer and construct  gas compression equipment for a floating production and storage installation  in Norway's JOTUN oil and gas field.</p>
<p>The JOTUN project is being constructed by Kvaerner on behalf of Esso  Exploration and Production Norway A.S..</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
